 *   - 0.96-inch I2C OLED
 *   - SSD1306
 *   - 128 x 64 pixels
 *
 * Parking Space Available:
 *   Green LED = ON
 *   Red LED   = OFF
 *
 * Parking Space Occupied:
 *   Green LED = OFF
 *   Red LED   = ON
 *
 * Features:
 *   - Sequential ultrasonic measurements
 *   - Reduced ultrasonic sensor interference
 *   - State-change-only Serial output
 *   - OLED parking availability display
 *
